# PageUp/PageDown step the cell cursor a screen of rows, as in Project (#554).
# gantt-scroll.xml has 100 flat tasks. The harness window's project-body shows
# 17 rows, so paging steps 16; past the last task the cursor lands on the
# entry row (selected_task 100, one past the last task).
test project paging moves the cursor a screen of rows
  open ../fixtures/gantt-scroll.xml
  assert selected_task is 0
  key pagedown
  assert selected_task is 16
  key pagedown
  assert selected_task is 32
  key pageup
  assert selected_task is 16
  key pageup
  assert selected_task is 0
  key pagedown pagedown pagedown pagedown pagedown pagedown
  assert selected_task is 96
  key pagedown
  assert selected_task is 100
  key pageup
  assert selected_task is 84
